          "instructions": "Preserve the campaign crops, shoe silhouette and licensed wordmark. Use the original brush plate for the scroll reveal. The shader treatment and the sequence of shoe, tee and full look are web proposals. Keep the static brush and complete product pictures readable with reduced motion. The supplied artwork is approved for presenting this example.",
