          "direction": "Strong natural light, a clear subject and deliberate negative space. Mix clean editorial photography with the energy of expressive brush forms. Let electric blue or one supporting palette color carry the composition.",
          "avoid": [
            "Do not generate or imitate the official logo.",
            "Do not upload supplied photographs or artwork to a generator without separate permission.",
            "Avoid invented technical product claims or copying a person from the reference."
          ],
          "brief": "Create a new editorial image of {{subject}} for {{use}} in {{aspect_ratio}}. Use strong directional light, a clear focal point and space for an Inter Black Italic headline. Work with the approved Shifft palette. Generate no logos, brand names or performance claims. Use text direction only; supplied brand images are not authorized model inputs. Return as a candidate for owner review.",
