          "references": [
            {
              "label": "Campaign art direction",
              "url": "https://www.figma.com/design/SzFcirw1HfSCoQPKNjBz5d?node-id=186-2706",
              "embed": true
            }
          ],
          "icons": "Draw control icons on a 24px grid with rounded 2px strokes. Use light icons on dark controls and dark icons when a control switches to cyan. In New Arrivals, left and right arrows move between looks. On Our story, the down-right arrow points to the print editorial. Keep text labels or accessible names on the controls. The original brush arrow belongs to the campaign hero.",
